  "note": "GlassedTerrainTemplate: bleached summit crust with fused glass patches, ash-and-glass talus, then seven heat-crazed face values dark scorched to pale bone. Inset material cuts; runtime contour owns all geometry. Accepted ImageGen correction pass 1254x1254 (squares measured at 13-405, 431-823, 849-1241 px on both axes, gutters charcoal); cuts are 368 px, inset 12 px inside each measured square. Opaque fused plate, no alpha; summit glass patches are small and sparse on purpose so repeats do not read.",
